sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Cliente/Aplicación
    participant ProxyREST as FPCWithdrawalConsultationRestPS<br/>/honduras/pension/rest/FPCWithdrawalConsultation/v1
    participant Pipeline as FPCWithdrawalConsultationPP<br/>(Template: PensionHondurasTemplateFicohsa)
    participant ParamsBS as GetParametersRestBS
    participant CredXQ as ExtractCredentialsAPIFPC.Xquery
    participant LoginPS as CloudCodeLoginPS
    participant TransformReq as FPCWithdrawalConsultationToCloudCodeRestBS.Xquery
    participant CloudCodeBS as CloudCodeRestBS<br/>https://apiqa.afpficohsa.com/api/v2
    participant TransformResp as CloudCodeRestToFPCWithdrawalConsultation.Xquery
    participant ErrorBS as GetCustomErrorByStackTraceRegionalRestBS
    participant TransformErr as ErrorMapeoRegionalToFPCWithdrawalConsultation.Xquery
    participant LogBS as LoggingRegionalRestBS

    Note over Client, CloudCodeBS: Flujo HN01 — FPCWithdrawalConsultation (POST)

    Client->>ProxyREST: POST /honduras/pension/rest/FPCWithdrawalConsultation/v1
    Note right of Client: Content-Type: application/json<br/>Auth: HTTP Basic over SSL<br/>Body: {GeneralInfo, RequestNumber, ClientId}

    ProxyREST->>Pipeline: Invoke Pipeline
    Note right of Pipeline: Política: oracle/http_basic_auth_over_ssl_service_policy

    %% Stage: StageAssigment
    Pipeline->>Pipeline: StageAssigment
    Note right of Pipeline: service = 'Pension/FPCWithdrawalConsultation'<br/>version = 'V1'<br/>key = 'ClientId'<br/>value = data($body/ClientId)<br/>method = 'REST'<br/>targetSystem = 'APIFPC'<br/>user = data($body//GeneralInfo/ApplicationId)

    %% Stage: GetSecurity (StageCloudCodeLogin)
    Pipeline->>ParamsBS: GetParameters
    Note right of Pipeline: parameterName = 'PG13516.SERVICE.ACCOUNT.APIFPC'
    ParamsBS-->>Pipeline: serviceAccountName (ej: APIFPC_SERVICE_USER)

    alt errorCode = 'SUCCESS'
        Pipeline->>CredXQ: ExtractCredentialsAPIFPC($serviceAccount)
        Note right of CredXQ: fn-bea:lookupBasicCredentials('SB_Security/Common/{ACCOUNT_NAME}')
        CredXQ-->>Pipeline: credentials (userName, userPassword)

        Pipeline->>LoginPS: cloudCodeLogin
        Note right of Pipeline: userName, password, timestamp<br/>forceLogin = false
        LoginPS-->>Pipeline: sesionToken (Bearer token)
    end

    %% Stage: TransformRegionalToTargetSystem
    alt errorCode = 'SUCCESS'
        Pipeline->>TransformReq: FPCWithdrawalConsultationToCloudCodeRestBS
        Note right of TransformReq: RequestNumber → numeroSolicitud<br/>ClientId → numeroIdentificacion
        TransformReq-->>Pipeline: requestService (CloudCode format)
    end

    %% Stage: StageLogginInput
    Pipeline->>LogBS: SaveLogInFileSystem (REQUEST)
    Note right of LogBS: messageType = 'REQUEST'

    %% Stage: InvokeCountry
    Pipeline->>CloudCodeBS: GET /retiros?numeroSolicitud={}&numeroIdentificacion={}
    Note right of CloudCodeBS: Header: Authorization = $sesionToken<br/>Timeout: 70s / ConnTimeout: 65s

    alt HTTP 200 - error = 'false' (Éxito)
        CloudCodeBS-->>Pipeline: {error:"false", datos:{retiros:{...}}}
        Note right of Pipeline: codeErrorService = 'Success'<br/>statusService = 'Success'

    else HTTP 401 (Token Expirado)
        CloudCodeBS-->>Pipeline: HTTP 401
        Note over Pipeline: Error Handler: ErrorHandlerInvokeCountry

        Pipeline->>CredXQ: ExtractCredentialsAPIFPC (re-extract)
        CredXQ-->>Pipeline: credentials

        Pipeline->>LoginPS: cloudCodeLogin (forceLogin=true)
        LoginPS-->>Pipeline: nuevo sesionToken

        Pipeline->>CloudCodeBS: GET /retiros (retry con nuevo token)
        CloudCodeBS-->>Pipeline: Response

    else Otro Error
        CloudCodeBS-->>Pipeline: Error/Fault
        Note right of Pipeline: codeErrorService = fault errorCode<br/>statusService = 'Error'<br/>errorMessage extraído del fault
    end

    %% Stage: StageLoggingOutput
    Pipeline->>LogBS: SaveLogInFileSystem (RESPONSE)
    Note right of LogBS: messageType = 'RESPONSE'

    %% Stage: TransformTargetSystemToRegional
    alt codeErrorService = 'SUCCESS'
        Pipeline->>TransformResp: CloudCodeRestToFPCWithdrawalConsultation
        Note right of TransformResp: datos/retiros/cuenta → Account<br/>datos/retiros/nombreCliente → ClientName<br/>datos/retiros/numeroIdentificacion → IdNumber<br/>datos/retiros/formaPago → PaymentMethod<br/>datos/retiros/moneda → Currency<br/>datos/retiros/monto → Amount<br/>datos/retiros/tipoRetiro → WithdrawalType<br/>datos/retiros/cuentaBancaria → BankingAccount
        TransformResp-->>Pipeline: FPCWithdrawalConsultationResponse (Success)
    else Error
        Pipeline->>ErrorBS: process (mapeo error regional)
        Note right of ErrorBS: systemApplication = $targetSystem<br/>service = $service<br/>errorCode, errorMessage, language
        ErrorBS-->>Pipeline: errorMappingRegionalOutput

        Pipeline->>TransformErr: ErrorMapeoRegionalToFPCWithdrawalConsultation
        Note right of TransformErr: code, error, description, shortDescription<br/>+ SystemId, SystemStatus, MessageId, Messages
        TransformErr-->>Pipeline: FPCWithdrawalConsultationResponse (Error)
    end

    Pipeline-->>ProxyREST: Response
    ProxyREST-->>Client: HTTP 200 (Success o Error en body)
